    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d449">

                <pb facs="0829" n="719" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg719"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Grip to Mr.
                            Wharton.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Sweden and Norway</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-08-09"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi> 9, 1890</date>.
                        (Received August 13.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge
                    the receipt of your communication of the 5th instant, inclosing me a letter from
                    the Secretary of the Navy, who does me the honor to invite me to be present at
                    the embarkation of the mortal remains of John Ericsson on the ship of war <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Baltimore</hi> at New York on the 23d instant.</p>
                <p>I take the liberty to transmit herewith a reply by which I have the honor to
                    accept the invitation which the Navy Department has kindly addressed to me.</p>
                <p>Be pleased to accept, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">A. Grip.</hi></signed></closer>


                <xi:include href="d449-a1.xml" xpointer="d449-a1"/>
            </div>
